For a refutation, prove a concrete witness against the actual machine functions.
For a proof, prove the behavior of the machine functions on the finite domain and
then use the specification. Use List.finRange and List.all to check finite cases,
and List.all_eq_true and List.mem_finRange to recover a fact for an arbitrary
element. Use cbv for closed machine computations and decide for small pure facts.
The driver sets high cbv step and heartbeat limits. Use the ARM model through
machineSum and machineBound. The disassembly and emulated outputs are hints only.
